   "source": [
    "## 5. Timing Cost Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Analyze the cost of execution timing relative to the decision price."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Calculate timing costs\n",
